# DigitalGuardian area 53 (world 1baa96c2, 09_cliff_temple_dark): the arms of fn_14_94BC FaceTarget,
# fn_14_8794 ProjectileAttack, fn_14_77EC SetProtectKneesFaceTarget, fn_14_7BD4 SetupBossEnergyBar,
# fn_14_7504/73D4 (melee leg and range), fn_14_A468/458C/20E4 (anim events) that the fight does not
# take: statecall/codecall/uevent with the body (e00350060), the head (e0035000f), the IS04 counter
# actor (e0035005f) and the knee armours (u0578..u057b, created by fn_14_4080 on load).
# Run: tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/digitalguardian_states.py <out> 1baa96c2,09_cliff_temple_dark
#   --con tools/cov/specs/digitalguardian_arms.con --fast --frames 5000
