# 77EC with the body inactive (Think, so fn_14_3F90, does not clear the id of a deleted
# armour): u0579 is gone but its id is still there. The body is in its loop attack first, so a
# FaceTarget update can be issued and, when 77EC leaves 0x1278 zero, is over (94BC).
